WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.464 --> 00:00:18.628
Brad: Are we there Danny: Why do you keep asking that question?

2
00:00:18.648 --> 00:00:22.549
Brad: Because it looks like we’re moving out of the city.

3
00:00:22.569 --> 00:00:24.410
Tina: You’re right.

4
00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:27.211
Hopian must live at the edge of the city.

5
00:00:27.231 --> 00:00:30.632
Danny: Look!

6
00:00:30.892 --> 00:00:31.632
There he is!

7
00:00:36.452 --> 00:00:38.693
Danny: Hopian, I’m so happy we found you.

8
00:00:38.713 --> 00:00:41.694
Danny: These are my friends, Brad and Tina.

9
00:00:41.734 --> 00:00:43.935
Hopian: Nice to meet you.

10
00:00:43.955 --> 00:00:45.776
I’m happy you’re here.

11
00:00:45.796 --> 00:00:49.298
Hopian: But, quickly, we must go inside.

12
00:00:49.318 --> 00:01:01.323
Tina: Danny: Everything is so big!

13
00:01:01.343 --> 00:01:04.204
Hopian: I hope you’ll be comfortable here.

14
00:01:05.228 --> 00:01:07.049
Brad: Is that your car, Hopian?

15
00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:09.531
It doesn’t look big enough for you.

16
00:01:09.551 --> 00:01:15.515
Hopian: Actually, that’s my son’s toy car.

17
00:01:15.535 --> 00:01:18.537
Danny: Your son’s toy car?

18
00:01:18.557 --> 00:01:21.940
Brad: I want to see how huge your TV is!

19
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.022
Hopian: It’s in the living room.

20
00:01:27.423 --> 00:01:28.544
Brad: Huh.

21
00:01:29.004 --> 00:01:30.285
I’m not that impressed.

22
00:01:30.305 --> 00:01:34.048
Danny: I think I’ve seen bigger TVs back home.

23
00:01:37.036 --> 00:01:39.057
Hopian: There’s someone I’d like you to meet.

24
00:01:39.637 --> 00:01:40.377
Come in, Bello.

25
00:01:40.397 --> 00:01:42.377
Tina: Who’s that?

26
00:01:42.858 --> 00:01:45.298
Hopian: This is my son, Bello.

27
00:01:46.459 --> 00:01:47.759
Brad: A baby giant?

28
00:01:48.739 --> 00:01:49.999
Tina: He’s so cute!

29
00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:52.920
Hopian: It’s okay, Bello.

30
00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:54.741
These are my friends.

31
00:01:55.401 --> 00:01:56.581
Hopian: They’re here to help.

32
00:01:57.361 --> 00:01:58.882
Do you know what he likes?

33
00:01:58.902 --> 00:02:00.402
Danny: What?

34
00:02:00.422 --> 00:02:03.103
Hopian: He likes to play catch.

35
00:02:04.263 --> 00:02:05.424
Tina: Let’s play!

36
00:02:14.788 --> 00:02:18.550
Whee! Hopian: He’s happy, playing with you.

37
00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:21.772
Tina: He’s a lot of fun to play with!

38
00:02:21.792 --> 00:02:26.855
Danny: Yes, but it’s hard work.

39
00:02:26.915 --> 00:02:33.378
Brad: Say, Hopian, did you send that magic bug to us?

40
00:02:33.398 --> 00:02:36.500
Hopian: How did you figure that out, Brad?

41
00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:39.301
Brad: Everything else was gray.

42
00:02:39.901 --> 00:02:41.222
But the bug was red.

43
00:02:41.242 --> 00:02:44.603
Hopian: I made it from Bello’s magic clay.

44
00:02:44.623 --> 00:02:47.184
Danny: That was a good plan, Hopian.

45
00:02:47.204 --> 00:02:51.146
Hopian: We need to work on our next plan tomorrow.

46
00:02:51.166 --> 00:02:55.008
Hopian: But now, it’s time for Bello to sleep.

47
00:02:55.668 --> 00:02:57.949
Come on, Bello, it’s bedtime.

48
00:02:57.969 --> 00:03:01.191
All three: Good night, Bello.

49
00:03:01.211 --> 00:03:03.852
Bello: Night!

50
00:03:07.168 --> 00:03:08.749
Hopian: Bello’s fast asleep.

51
00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:15.093
Brad: I don’t know about you guys, but I’m tired too.

52
00:03:15.113 --> 00:03:17.295
Tina: Me too.

53
00:03:18.115 --> 00:03:19.756
I think we’re all tired.

54
00:03:19.776 --> 00:03:22.378
Hopian: You’ll need your strength tomorrow.

55
00:03:22.398 --> 00:03:25.160
Danny: So where are we going to sleep?

56
00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:26.821
Hopian: Follow me.

57
00:03:27.422 --> 00:03:28.342
I think I know a spot.

58
00:03:28.402 --> 00:03:32.085
Hopian: Good night, Danny, Tina, and Brad.

59
00:03:32.105 --> 00:03:35.147
All three: Good night,
